   "title": "How to use (JanRT Studio)",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Kandinsky ImageSR 2.0: x4 (JanRT Studio)\nNeeds our node pack **ComfyUI-JanRT-Upscalers** (v0.1.0) and its weights: see the README.\nupscalers_portrait.png gives the result in the video.\n\n1. **Load your picture** (Load Image). Any picture: it works on pixels.\n2. **upscale_factor** 2 or 4. x4 of a 960x1280 picture takes about 43 s on a 16 GB card (the first load checks the weights, about 10 s more).\n3. **creativity**: 0 stays closest to your picture, 8 redraws the most. On real faces keep it at 0 to 4.\n4. **Keep the loader on bf16.** fp8 saves little on 16 GB."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Kandinsky ImageSR 2.0: x4 (JanRT Studio)\nNeeds our node pack **ComfyUI-JanRT-Upscalers** (v0.1.0) and its weights: see the README.\nupscalers_portrait.png gives the result in the video.\n\n1. **Load your picture** (Load Image). Any picture: it works on pixels.\n2. **upscale_factor** 2 or 4. x4 of a 960x1280 picture takes about 43 s on a 16 GB card (the first load checks the weights, about 10 s more).\n3. **creativity**: 0 stays closest to your picture, 8 redraws the most. On real faces keep it at 0 to 4.\n4. **Keep the loader on bf16.** fp8 saves little on 16 GB."
   },
